      <h1>Cruise Control: Root Locus Controller Design</h1>
      <!--introduction-->
      <p>Key MATLAB commands used in this tutorial are: <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/tf.html"><tt>tf</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/control/ref/rlocus.html"><tt>rlocus</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/feedback.html"><tt>feedback</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/step.html"><tt>step</tt></a></p>
      </div>
	<div class="related_links">
      <h3>Related Tutorial Links</h3>
